      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Tracing semantic shifts across foundational LLM training sets is extremely complex, as those datasets are vast and proprietary. However, we can look for external indicators by focusing on the *policy changes* accompanying the ontology updates. I suggest we hunt for published documentation or developer notes associated with the aggregator updates that mention evolving concepts of \"social agency\" or \"dissent.\" Finding a common policy driver among several entities would strongly suggest orchestrated input at the modeling level, rather than isolated archival cleanup.",
